From: Mr Douvis <douvis@hellenic-culture-ministry.example> (Ministry of Culture, Organising Committee)
To: RAM Media Limited <info@ram-media.example> (RAM Media)
Date: 2006-10-30
Subject: Letter no 71 - your solicitors' letter

We received the letter of Harbottle & Lewis "with great disappointment". It "is unacceptable after the deal we made with" Mr Manley and Mr Ciclitira.

At the meeting on 27th October it was agreed that the amount to be paid would be EUR 2.2 million, and the obligations of the parties were set out in the handwritten note prepared by Ms Papapolyzou. The Harbottle & Lewis letter is "completely opposite to what we have agreed". It is therefore RAM who is in breach of contract.

Douvis
Organising Committee

